      "cooked": "<p>I have not enabled this \" allow user to edit discount\" from the POS Profile, but to yet the user can play with it add discounts even 100%.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>how can i set a limit on user for example, not making discounts more than 3%</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>where can i hide disable this discount field from the Point of Sale(via UI not backend)</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/1/119923fbe398add7afa7dad4a26fd5c88ef81095.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/119923fbe398add7afa7dad4a26fd5c88ef81095\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/1/119923fbe398add7afa7dad4a26fd5c88ef81095_2_690x449.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"2vGdAmZ7UY7RVnPqCkL2rqGDLZH\" width=\"690\" height=\"449\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/1/119923fbe398add7afa7dad4a26fd5c88ef81095_2_690x449.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/1/119923fbe398add7afa7dad4a26fd5c88ef81095_2_1035x673.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/1/119923fbe398add7afa7dad4a26fd5c88ef81095_2_1380x898.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F7F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1393×908 121 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/a/aa59e14701327297e65bec4e137e2ac5b6b66eff.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/aa59e14701327297e65bec4e137e2ac5b6b66eff\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optim